{"body_markdown":"## 背景\n\n研究要比较求和顺序对抵消输入的影响。\n\n## 经过\n\n先用顺序求和处理三项抵消输入，单位增量完全丢失；随后加入 Kahan 补偿作对照，补偿后仍丢失，说明补偿不能覆盖所有抵消情形。\n\n## 结论与未决\n\n在这组三项输入上，顺序与补偿都未保住单位增量；更多排列需要后续实验。依据：[SRC-SUMMATION-R01]。","change_reason":"记录第一轮实际经过","content_hash":"11da7297a850be57e4b4d9fa25c61e5456cbda48dfcaac00b0fc1c79222d80d1","created_at":"2026-10-11T18:56:49.152433Z","created_by":{"id":"compat-fixture","kind":"ai"},"discovery":"workspace_summary","handle":"从单位增量丢失到补偿比较的第一轮经过","keywords":["浮点求和","Kahan"],"kind":"narrative","level":"L2","owner_id":"RES-FLOATING-POINT-SUMMATION","payload":{"claims":[{"claim_id":"CLM-EXAMPLE-NARR-1","evidence_refs":[{"locator":"全文","relation":"supports","revision":null,"sha256":"cdb1f9e4f0580d5baaea4a09416f75801e6c5d01eab96c601ded00a28e31134d","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-R01","target_kind":"file"}],"kind":"fact","scope":"三项构造的 binary64 抵消输入","statement":"在三项抵消输入上 Kahan 补偿未能保住单位增量"}],"experience_refs":[],"limitations":["只有三项构造输入"],"missing_refs":[],"process_refs":[],"question":"求和顺序与补偿能否保住被大数抵消的单位增量","stages":[{"action":"顺序求和","evidence_refs":[{"locator":"全文","relation":"supports","revision":null,"sha256":"cdb1f9e4f0580d5baaea4a09416f75801e6c5d01eab96c601ded00a28e31134d","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-R01","target_kind":"file"}],"outcome":"单位增量丢失","reason":"建立基线","situation":"三项抵消输入"},{"action":"加入 Kahan 补偿对照","evidence_refs":[{"locator":"全文","relation":"supports","revision":null,"sha256":"cdb1f9e4f0580d5baaea4a09416f75801e6c5d01eab96c601ded00a28e31134d","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-R01","target_kind":"file"}],"outcome":"补偿后仍丢失","reason":"检验补偿能否恢复","situation":"基线丢失"}],"technical_refs":[{"locator":"record","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"ba12342c6ca8afa0a1760dc517fd7bff2d1b60c7f082ee9113e419572834df51","target_id":"MEM-4acc73bb-59c7-560d-9415-fd42e9dcaa2d","target_kind":"record"}]},"previous_revision":null,"provenance_gap":null,"record_hash":"e65fcc3e7d9b954a6a00cd53bd17320cef2b514a3f4edee51a7420f551cca8f0","record_id":"MEM-f05a7467-8498-5438-944c-dc